WEBVTT

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.920
What do I do? What do I do?

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.510
I told you, didn't I?

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.310
There's no use running.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.130
But I guess you wouldn't 
understand me, anyway,

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.560
since you're a monster and everything.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:17.810
Hey!

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.200
I said, stop!

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:25.780
Aw, man...

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:27.740
Tiona-san!

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:28.370
Huh?

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.540
What happened to them?

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.740
Sorry! They got away!

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.160
We will assist you.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:33.900
Okay!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.360
<i>That </i>was<i> a monster... right?</i>

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:42.020
Bell... Bell!

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.000
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:16.490
Ultra Soul
Decisive Battle

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:17.710
Haruhime-san!

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:20.910
Bell-sama? Wiene-sama is—

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.370
I know. Our goddess told me.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.450
Let's go. Please, hold on tight.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.740
A-All right.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:33.960
Huh?

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.500
Fels, Wiene is gone.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:38.810
I am aware.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.640
However, right now, even if 
it is just us, we must go.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.090
To the western door.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.580
Let's go!

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.390
What tepid attacks!

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:01.480
Mikoto!

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:13.160
Finally, you reveal yourself.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:18.040
That way!

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:18.850
Head it off!

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:19.210
There!

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:29.660
Found it.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.690
S-Stay back!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.690
This is bad!

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.690
<i>I'm sure they'll be scared of me again.</i>

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.730
<i>But... even so...</i>

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.030
<i>Bell...</i>

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.110
<i>saved me!</i>

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.410
Over there!

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:04.930
It attacked a child!

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:05.670
It's running!

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.710
Fire!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:08.800
I'll go! I'll leave this to you!

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:09.750
Understood!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.880
<i>At this rate, he'll take me out.</i>

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.130
<i>One magic sword left.</i>

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:20.850
<i>But if I use this, even that guy would...</i>

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.850
Concern for the enemy, Welf-kichi?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.280
You really think a fledgling's 
magic sword could fell this guy?

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.770
That voice. Tsubaki?

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:31.920
Tsubaki! Why are you here?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.670
Why do you think? My master entreated 
me to come and help you.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.830
Hephaistios-sama did that?

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.100
Hurry up and steel your determination!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.700
Or are you going to stand 
by and watch that one die?

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.850
Run riot...

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.140
Hiyou!

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.630
Take a look.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:08.400
See? He's alive.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.320
You can't run any more.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:33.550
Yup. Somehow, I just can't take you down!

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.590
I think you saved that 
kid back there, right?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.570
I don't know if you understand 
what I'm saying,

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.960
but you should hurry up and go.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.520
Not everyone's as dumb as I am.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:52.160
Huh?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.640
I wonder if this is how Argonaut-kun 
started feeling, too.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:00.250
Tiona!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:01.830
Where's the monster?

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.590
Sorry! I let it go!

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.050
What?! You let it go?!

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:12.970
Bell...

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:15.480
Wiene!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.120
Bell! Haruhime!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.320
Wiene-sama!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.410
Thank goodness, Wiene!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.610
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:27.360
I'm sorry!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.830
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.890
<i>Thank you! I love you!</i>

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.860
Wiene, let's hurry to Fels and the others.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:35.920
Okay.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:39.030
Then, I'll level boost you again, Bell-sama.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.130
Bell-sama...

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:46.710
Get out here!

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:50.470
You can't erase your scent. Hurry up.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.170
<i>Bete-san...</i>

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.020
I have no choice but to go—

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.310
Huh?

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.740
The rest of you, get out here, too!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.410
I am alone.

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.890
Don't give me that garbage.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.030
I am alone, so please leave!

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:11.660
<i>Haruhime-san...</i>

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:16.860
That way, huh?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.500
You're in the way. Move.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:20.780
Huh?

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:24.510
A helpless nobody giving 
me a look like that.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:26.670
You must be ready for this, then, huh?

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.080
Get bigger...

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.090
Huh?

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.710
That power, that vessel.

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.330
Many treasures and many wishes.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.220
Until the bell tolls...

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:45.360
May you have glory and fantasies.

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:49.740
Uchide no Kozuchi!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.460
What do you think you're doing,
 you pathetic fox?

00:07:58.760 --> 00:08:00.080
But I suppose,

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.290
seeing the way that expression of yours 
is shaping up, I'll forgive you.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.930
This is stupid.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:07.540
In the end, you're just leaving 
it to someone else, huh?

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:11.220
My little sister's fights are my fights.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.540
I'll give you a beat down.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.040
Bring it, you stupid woman.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.440
I'll take that hot head of 
yours and kick it to a pulp.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.810
<i>Bell-kun, we're out of time.</i>

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:25.240
<i>If you don't hurry, you won't be able 
to meet up with Fels-kun and the others.</i>

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:27.800
Understood! We're headed there now—

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.740
<i>What's wrong, Bell-kun? Bell-kun!</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:32.790
Bell?

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.010
Five years...

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.450
She has created such a disparity between us.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.930
Cranel-san, I am sorry.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.240
You're there, aren't you, vouivre?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:50.970
Come out.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.590
Why did you ask what you did back then?

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.340
I've been wondering about it ever since.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:06.730
Ais-san, if monsters had a reason to live...

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:10.240
If they had emotions that weren't 
any different from ours...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.480
What would you do?

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:16.670
This is what you meant.

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:18.500
Ais-san, this girl is—

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.190
My answer will not change.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.030
If someone will be made to cry 
because of monsters, then...

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.070
I will kill monsters!

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:28.800
Why...

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.290
Why?

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.950
Why?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.750
<i>Please, listen! The Xenos are—</i>

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.550
<i>I have no need!</i>

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.750
Ais-san!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.550
When that vouivre goes on another rampage, 
will you be able to say the same thing?

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.220
I can't do that.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.530
Damn it!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.100
You've grown stronger.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.620
I can't go easy on you anymore.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:20.840
Bell!

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.520
Firebolt!

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:45.240
Aisha-san!

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:48.090
Aisha-san! Aisha-san!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.410
I'm not going to die because of this.

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:55.810
But... But...

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:01.580
If you've got time to cry, isn't there
 something else you should be doing?

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:04.130
Yes.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.220
Then go.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.110
After I've rested a bit, 
I'll get on the move, too.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.230
Thank you so much, Aisha-san.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:22.330
All I've done lately is lose.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.760
Honestly...

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.880
Wiene, are you all right?

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.490
Yes.

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:32.960
I'm fine.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:34.200
<i>This is no good.</i>

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.320
<i>Trying to get away from Ais-san like this...</i>

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.550
<i>It's just too...</i>

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:42.590
Huh? This place...

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.770
Right. From back then...

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:54.060
<i>Goddess. If I'm right, there's a secret 
passage near here, isn't there?</i>

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:54.840
Huh?

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:59.330
Yeah, there is, but it'd be taking the 
long way around to Fels and the others...

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.680
<i>Please, tell me where it is.</i>

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:04.400
Bell?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.390
Take this and head down this path.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.770
What about you, Bell?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.120
I'll stay here.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:16.760
Why?

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.720
I want to talk with Ais-san.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.870
I'm sure she'll come here.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:24.680
It's all right.

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:26.900
I'll go soon, too.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.100
As long as you listen to our goddess,
 you'll be fine.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:31.890
Bell...

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:33.810
Now, go on.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:43.760
I haven't changed at all.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.060
I'm still as weak as I was then.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.960
Move.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.200
I will not!

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>What's wrong, Wiene-kun? Take a right there.</i>

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.350
Goddess, I don't want this.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.570
I don't want to say goodbye like this.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:28.280
<i>Bell said he'd come later, but he was lying.</i>

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.250
Bell saved me.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.520
It makes me happy, but it's wrong!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.320
I don't want Bell to get hurt.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.910
I don't want him to cry!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:45.870
I haven't done anything for Bell!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.330
<i>I was the same way.</i>

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:49.930
What?

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.670
You know how Bell-kun 
doesn't play fair, right?

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.640
He always pushes himself too 
hard and tries to look good.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.480
That boy, when a girl is in trouble...

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.530
<i>No, when family is in trouble, 
he can't abandon them.</i>

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.690
Family?

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.020
<i>That's right.</i>

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:14.830
<i>Wiene-kun, you're part of 
his precious family, too.</i>

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.900
<i>That's how he thinks of you.</i>

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:22.930
Goddess, I want to go to Bell.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:25.070
<i>I really don't want things to be this way.</i>

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:28.520
Are you prepared to face the consequences?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.010
You may have to say goodbye 
to Bell-kun forever.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.270
Are you prepared to die?

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.170
Yes.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.220
This time, I want to save Bell.

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:42.610
All right.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:47.160
<i>Wiene-kun...</i>

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.300
<i>You've grown so strong.</i>

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.750
Why are you going this far?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.860
She isn't a person. She's a monster.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.570
She can speak.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.020
She can smile at me.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:27.280
She has the same emotions we do!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.920
They are not the same!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.610
Monsters kill people.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.400
They've killed so many—

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.030
That's the same!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.840
All of that, we're just the same!

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:40.100
Ais-san's sword!

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.790
My knife!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:48.830
I've had enough.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.790
I will cut you.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.680
It's going to hurt a lot.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.120
So please...

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.580
No!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.310
Don't bully Bell!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:04.820
Wiene?

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:08.160
Please, don't hurt Bell!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.520
Stop that. Don't speak.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.870
Why does someone like you exist?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.300
What is your objective?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.760
I... want to stay with Bell!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.420
I will not allow that.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.370
Your claws hurt people.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.350
Your wings terrify people.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:36.300
Your red stone will end 
up killing many people.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.200
Letting you have your way on the 
surface like those other monsters...

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.550
I will never allow it!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.640
I cannot let you go!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.240
Wiene!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.330
Wiene!

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:38.710
If I ever... stop being myself again...

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.190
Next time, I'll disappear 
like I'm supposed to!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:44.240
I was all alone...

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.910
In a dark, cold place.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:52.390
Since before I became me... for so long...

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.360
It was scary.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.960
It was lonely.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:01.330
No one held me close.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:05.610
But... Bell saved me!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.060
I was pitch black...

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.280
And Bell saved me!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:18.900
I can no longer kill that vouivre.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:20.430
You...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.440
None of you are wrong.

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:25.940
That is what I have come 
to believe, and so...

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:31.610
Huh?

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:34.020
Go.

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:39.140
<i>Thank you, Ais-san.</i>

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:56.290
<i>Bell-kun...</i>

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:58.590
<i>I've managed to contact Haruhime-kun.</i>

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.660
Really, Goddess?

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.360
Yeah. I've confirmed that 
Miss Supporter is safe.

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:06.610
And I have one more piece of good news.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.610
Haruhime-kun has found some of 
the Xenos who got separated.

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.260
<i>It seems they have a key to Knossos, too.</i>

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:14.820
Really? How?

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:19.740
<i>One of the Xenos, a black 
minotaur, entrusted it to them.</i>

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:23.460
<i>It's probably the one 
Wallenwhatsit-kun fought before.</i>

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.460
A black minotaur?

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.890
<i>At any rate, they're coming to pick you up.</i>

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.860
<i>Head for the door with them.</i>

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.320
Understood!

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.020
Yes, Hestia-sama.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:41.520
We have also conveyed Wiene-dono and the 
others' safety to Fels-dono and the rest.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.310
They felt reassured and headed 
into the secret passage.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:47.300
They should reach the western door soon.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:57.370
There's really a door no one 
knows about down this path?

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:58.280
Yes.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.970
Our kin who entrusted this to us told us so.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:05.430
He said this was how he reached the surface.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.720
I see.

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:09.570
Then, this is farewell.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:11.970
Thank you so much, truly!

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.730
We will never forget our debt of gratitude.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:18.860
If you're ever in trouble, 
we'll be the ones to rush to your sides!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:19.820
Thank you.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.890
Bell...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:21.650
Yes?

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.940
When I was separated from you and 
the others, I cried the whole time.

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.390
But if I do that, you and the others 
will worry about me, right?

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.900
So I'm not going to cry anymore!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.310
That way, we'll meet again, right?

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.140
Yes, we will.

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.680
We'll be able to live together again, right?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.200
Yes! Absolutely.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.650
I'll make you a promise.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.570
One day, I'll make a place where 
we can all live together.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.450
Then, shall we pinky swear?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.240
Pinky swear?

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.150
Yes.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:54.300
It's a ritual of vow-making in my homeland.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.350
You take your littlest fingers...

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.950
And place them like this.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:14.010
Th-Th-Th-Th-The thousand year old notebook!

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:14.700
Huh?

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.290
It can't be...

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.000
Are these notes...

00:22:57.630 --> 00:22:59.550
What is this?

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:00.980
A dead end?

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:02.630
It can't be!

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:08.110
The fact that there was a door here 
was written in Daedalus' notes!

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:10.460
Oh, sorry about that!

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:12.680
That was a fake.

00:23:15.780 --> 00:23:18.450
Pleased to meet you, 
ladies and gentlemen of the Xenos.

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.860
My name is Hermes.

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:22.830
I'm just a simple god.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:25.810
Lord Hermes, what is the meaning of this?

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:30.300
Nothing much. I just have 
a little request of you.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.630
Won't you die, please,

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:35.730
you heretical monsters?

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>Argonaut
Hero's Return</b>

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:38.530
Next time,

00:23:38.530 --> 00:23:39.780
"Argonaut."
